<view class="page order-detail" wx:if="{{order}}"><view class="success">⚡<view wx:if="{{syncState==='synced'}}">订单已送达！</view><view wx:elif="{{syncState==='failed'}}">订单已保存本机，云端同步失败</view><view wx:else>正在确认云端订单…</view><text wx:if="{{syncState==='synced'}}">主厨快来接单啦 ❤️</text><text wx:elif="{{syncState==='failed'}}">请点击下方按钮重试同步</text><text wx:else>请稍等，等待云端确认</text></view><view class="paper cream-card"><view class="paper-title">小霞饱饱食堂 ⚡</view><view class="paper-sub">闪电专送 · 新订单</view><view class="meta"><view>订单编号：{{order.id}}</view><view>订单时间：{{order.time}}</view><view>订单状态：{{order.statusLabel}}</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="label">🍽 点餐内容</view><view wx:for="{{food}}" wx:key="id" class="entry"><text>{{item.name}} × {{item.qty}}</text><text>⚡ {{item.price*item.qty}}</text></view><view class="label" wx:if="{{service.length}}">💗 特殊服务</view><view wx:for="{{service}}" wx:key="id" class="entry"><text>{{item.name}} × {{item.qty}}</text><text>⚡ 0</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="note">口味偏好：{{order.taste||'无'}}</view><view class="note">备注：{{order.note||'无'}}</view><view class="total">合计 ⚡ {{order.total}}</view></view><view class="sync-note">{{syncMessage}}</view><button wx:if="{{syncState==='failed'}}" class="btn btn-light sync-retry" bindtap="syncOrder">重试同步云端</button><view class="send-tip">云端同步成功后，主厨进入接单页面即可查看。也可以复制订单，通过微信聊天发送。</view><button class="btn copy" bindtap="copy">📋 复制完整订单</button><button class="btn btn-light share" open-type="share">分享小程序给主厨</button><button class="again" bindtap="reorder">再来一单 →</button></view>
